   Shintaro and Kubo, Tatsuhiko and Nakajima, Yukie and Kagi, Naoki and
   Hoshi, Tanji and Suzuki, Masaru and Kario, Kazuomi and Yoshimura,
   Takesumi and Yoshino, Hiroshi and Murakami, Shuzo and Smart Wellness
